 <properties>
  <property name="family">WCH RISC-V MCU</property>
  <property name="chip">CH32V203</property>
  <property name="pins">20</property>
  <property name="part number">CH32V203F8U6</property>
  <property name="package">QFN20</property>
 </properties>
 <description>WCH CH32V203F8U6 RISC-V MCU, QFN20 3x3 mm / 0.4 mm pitch, 3.3 V, 64K flash / 20K SRAM, 17 I/O, 2x USART (PA9/PA10, PA2/PA3), I2C2 on PB10/PB11, 9+2 ch 12-bit ADC. No NRST / BOOT0 pin (BOOT0 is tied to GND internally) - SWD only, reset by power cycle. Exposed pad = pin 0 / VSS - route to GND.</description>
